<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Me</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #1f2b4a;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 12% 10%, #ffe87a 0 8%, transparent 9%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 88% 12%, #ff9dd5 0 7%, transparent 8%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 84%, #86ffd5 0 8%, transparent 9%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 86% 88%, #8ad4ff 0 9%, transparent 10%),
                linear-gradient(160deg, #fff4d6 0%, #ffe0f0 35%, #ddf8ff 72%, #e4ffef 100%);
        }
        .header {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .content-section {
            margin: 30px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffffd9;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 2px solid #e5e9ff;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(58, 79, 132, 0.12);
            text-align: left;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .back-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, #ff7db8, #ff5f95);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .back-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .highlight-box {
            background-color: #dcffe9;
            color: #1b6a43;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid #3ac889;
        }
        .credit-box {
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #4c5784;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        a {
            color: #5f26ce;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to Home</a>
        <h1>About me 😄</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <p>Hi there, I am Max. I began my musical journey playing the flute and pursued both my Bachelor's and Master's degrees at Hong Kong Baptist University. During my undergraduate studies, I took up the bassoon as my second instrument, flute was my major instrument, that is quite important. After graduating from HKBU, I pursued a Master of Composition degree at the Royal Birmingham Conservatoire. I also taught myself Python so I can hop on the AI hype train. I am now back in Hong Kong, developing an app while start learning the clarinet.</p>
        
        <p><strong>Huge thanks to my composition teachers in UK:</strong> Andrew Toovey and Ed Bennett.</p>
        <p><strong>My flute teacher:</strong> Brian Chan and Olivier Nowak.</p>
        <p><strong>My bassoon teacher:</strong> Angel Cheung.</p>

        <div class="highlight-box">
            For more feedback, information or lessons, please contact me at: <a href="mailto:chakhangc@yahoo.com.hk">chakhangc@yahoo.com.hk</a>.<br>
            Also see my YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeJw45clCLOABqXxKhHoAlA" target="_blank">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeJw45clCLOABqXxKhHoAlA</a><br>
            My Github repo: <a href="https://github.com/maxchanhi" target="_blank">https://github.com/maxchanhi</a>
        </div>

        <div class="credit-box">
            A huge credit goes to my girlfriend, Phoebe, who has been a tremendous support and has provided many fun ideas.
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/ai_chat') %>
</body>
</html>
